---
import { enquiryPath } from '../lib/site';
const enquiryUrl = enquiryPath('website');
---

<section class="website-offer" id="website-offer" aria-labelledby="website-offer-title">
	<div class="offer-heading">
		<div><p class="eyebrow">Larger or custom websites</p>
		<h2 id="website-offer-title">Know the cost<br />before we build.</h2></div>
		<a class="text-link" href="#website-terms">Ownership, exclusions and payment details <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
	</div>

	<div class="pricing" aria-label="Website pricing">
		<div class="price-card primary">
			<p class="price-label">Project price</p>
			<p class="price">From <span>A$6,500</span></p>
			<p>Planning, design and writing for up to five core pages, one agreed interactive feature and two review rounds.</p>
			<a href={enquiryUrl}>Discuss a website project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
		</div>
		<div class="price-card managed">
			<p class="price-label">Managed payment option</p>
			<p class="price"><span>A$1,490</span> upfront</p>
			<p class="monthly">then A$299 a month for 24 months from launch</p>
			<p class="total"><span>A$8,666</span> minimum total including the upfront payment</p>
			<p>Build and defined care included. Available by written proposal.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="offer-currency">All prices are in AUD. GST is not currently charged. The proposal confirms timing once the scope, content, access and review process are understood.</p>

	<div class="offer-disclosures" id="website-terms">
		<details><summary>What the custom scope includes</summary><ul><li>One planning workshop and a written project scope</li><li>Custom structure, design and writing for up to five core pages</li><li>One focused interactive feature with agreed inputs and outputs</li><li>Two consolidated review rounds</li><li>Search and analytics setup, enquiry testing, launch and handover</li></ul></details>
		<details><summary>Managed care after launch</summary><p>Available where included in the project proposal. It covers the scoped build plus hosting, backups, monitoring, scheduled form checks, up to 30 minutes of small edits each month and a quarterly review. After the 24-month term, choose handover to your own hosting or ask for a separately quoted care arrangement.</p></details>
		<details><summary>Ownership and responsibilities</summary><p>Your domain and business accounts stay in your name. Before work starts, the proposal sets out hosting costs, care limits, the payment schedule, how launch delays affect billing, and the ownership, cancellation and early-handover terms. Monitoring does not include a staffed 24-hour response.</p></details>
		<details><summary>Work that needs a separate quote</summary><p>Online shops, customer accounts, complex booking systems, external integrations and larger data-backed tools sit outside the starting scope. Large content migrations, photography, logo work, legal writing and third-party fees are also quoted separately when needed.</p></details>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
 .website-offer { padding-block:var(--section-space); border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
 .offer-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; align-items:start; margin-bottom:3rem; }
 .offer-heading .text-link { font-size:.95rem; }
 .pricing { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.25rem; }
 .price-card { padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem); border:1px solid #948d94; background:var(--white); }
 .price-card.managed { background:#f8cee3; }
 .price-card p { color:var(--muted); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.65; }
 .price-card .price-label { margin:0 0 1rem; color:var(--ink); font-weight:800; font-size:1.2rem; }
 .price-card .price { margin:0; color:var(--ink); font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:800; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-.04em; }
 .price span { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.1vw,4rem); letter-spacing:-.06em; }
 .price-card .monthly { color:var(--ink); font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:750; }
 .price-card .total { margin-top:.6rem; color:var(--ink); }
 .price-card a { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:1.5rem; min-height:44px; margin-top:1rem; font-weight:780; }
 .offer-currency { font-size:.9rem; color:var(--muted); }
 .offer-disclosures { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:0 3rem; margin-top:2rem; }
 .offer-disclosures details { border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
 .offer-disclosures summary { min-height:60px; padding-block:1.2rem; cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
 .offer-disclosures p,.offer-disclosures ul { margin:0 0 1.5rem; font-size:1rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
 .offer-disclosures li+li { margin-top:.5rem; }
 @media(max-width:760px) { .offer-heading{display:block}.offer-heading .text-link{margin-top:1.5rem}.pricing,.offer-disclosures{grid-template-columns:1fr}.price-card{padding:1.5rem} }
</style>
